  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Sand Heap blessed land he obstructs Fang Dong Xi with a killer move after closed cultivation of several years, laughing that this first battle after coming out must make his name famous and that the other Gu Immortals are stepping stones. Fang Dong Xi says Shi Kang specializes in defensive killer moves and can turn into a rockman. His face is swollen and blue from the beating, his vision blurry and his speech garbled, yet he still claims he is in peak condition. When his right leg cracks, he presses rocks into the gap with a killer move and restores the rockman transformation for the moment. The pig-head land spirit’s condition is that the person who can take the most beatings will be master. Peng Da’s soul realizes Shi Kang has been rampant outside because he is trying to be beaten up through all means after learning the condition from ancient desolate beast beatings. Western Desert righteous path holds back from killing him to avoid Shi clan retaliation.",
      "chapters": [
        2130
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_sand_heap_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_dong_xi",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_peng_da",
        "reg_western_desert",
        "fac_shi_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He becomes Sand Heap blessed land’s owner after the contest ends.",
      "chapters": [
        2131
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-owner",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a rank seven Gu Immortal from Shi clan who cultivates earth path. With Zuo Qiu Yan Ming and Tuoba Feng Yan he spends three days and nights wiping out a dragon crocodile group, and his method lets them enter a dragon crocodile’s stomach. Compared with ostracized Shi Zhong, he is a popular person in Shi clan. After he obtained Sand Heap blessed land the clan rewarded him immediately, and the dragon crocodiles he killed stay as his property. On the journey toward Wan clan’s anti-Fang gathering he leads the others to rest at myriad ore desert.",
      "chapters": [
        2222
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dragon-crocodiles-and-clan-favor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
